==Trivia==
* In the English [[Chuang Yi]] translation, the coconut is called a berry.
* The appearance of [[Pallet Town]] and [[Professor Oak's Laboratory]] in this chapter may have been inspired by West City and Capsule Corporation from [[wp:Dragon_Ball_(manga)|''Dragon Ball'']], respectively.
* In ''[[PM003|Bring Down the Powerful Opponent Onix!!]]'', [[Red's Pikachu (Pocket Monsters)|Red's Pikachu]] is introduced as a main character and is heavely implied to be a previously unknown Pokémon. Despite this, a completly different and more agressive Pikachu appears in this chapter as one of Nidoran♂'s friends

